e7f64ac1", "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-6f11c87cc5040e8aadcd0c3d", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["wrong_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/04f0c7eb45f2596acd75d025e7738238b7dbde17d2cb62bb9bc8a1c11949f513.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "04f0c7eb45f2596acd75d025e7738238b7dbde17d2cb62bb9bc8a1c11949f513", "user_turn_count": 4, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 349], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "993ba0c21352571582845af207364375d336f013f2afd5f2c0bba68d095eb8c5", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 180], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "6fdd37d335372dcd25fe52275a66e1327bebd0be7350c654fbce5ffc8e6e37e0", "role": "user", "sequence": 3}, {"character_range": [0, 56], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "7fa55dea966246ee2719f5306a0c192b88f149b95665d73619f212b10bcd370d", "role": "user", "sequence": 5}, {"character_range": [0, 162], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "d21eb6904a0aef1f199be30870bba3c3c2426b8e4e1b561cfa37778977349d49", "role": "user", "sequence": 7}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "*附件顺序（原消息）：解析图 `assets/Q02_57849_solution.png`；题目图 `assets/Q02_57849_question.png`。*\n\n这道题考试的时候该怎么做呢？完全无从下手啊！\n\n这道题他说存在，那我只能想到根据导数定义：$\\lim\\_{x \\to x\\_0} \\frac{f(x, y\\_0) - f(x\\_0, y\\_0)}{x - x\\_0}$ 等于一个常数 $C\\_1$ 是存在的。然后在 $y$ 处的偏导数也是同理。\n\n那这几个 A、B、C、D 什么关系啊？我完全想不到。\n\n对，我都忘记这部分知识了。跟 A、B、C 的选项有什么关系？我是落了什么知识储备吗？这道题如果在考场上，该怎么快速做出来呢？\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"m006\"></a>"}